Package: nexus-launcher
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ne-x-us-vault <https://github.com/Ne-x-us-vault>
Depends: gjs, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Suggests: gnome-shell, rofi
Description: Frost-glass application launcher for GNOME Shell and other desktops
 A keyboard-first, frost-glass application launcher. Ships a GNOME Shell
 extension (custom-launcher@nexus.dev), a standalone GTK4 launcher that runs
 on any desktop environment, and a matching Rofi theme.
